Medium Impact:
- Styled ConfirmDialog component (replaces native confirm/alert)
- Tab context: rename on double-click, reconnect on error
- SFTP breadcrumb navigation with sortable columns
- Command palette (Ctrl+K) for quick navigation and host connect

Professional Polish:
- About dialog with version info
- Status bar (active host, session count, duration, shortcut hint)
- Keyboard shortcuts reference in Settings

Performance:
- Batched terminal writes (16ms accumulation ~60fps)
- Terminal themes loaded as separate chunk
- Debounced resize observer (50ms)
- Loading skeleton component
